# ＠備考◆気まずさ→照れ／困り／他人事で実感がない

@char Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Cry_Open
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@Wait 0.1
@shakeStageCamera 0 { Force:0.01,-0.01,0 Frequency:1800 damp:0 time:180 }
